        "<b>Hypoglycemia</b> (commonly below 70 mg/dL): shaky, sweaty, tachycardic, confused. Stop, check glucose, give fast carbs if able to swallow, recheck.",
        "<b>Hyperglycemia/DKA</b>: polyuria, polydipsia, fruity breath, Kussmaul breathing; DKA is an emergency.",
