        ["Which statement about hemoglobin values for therapy is MOST accurate?", ["Thresholds vary and are read with symptoms and trends", "One universal cutoff applies to every patient", "Hemoglobin has no relevance to exercise tolerance", "Only platelet count matters before mobility"], "Hemoglobin guidance varies; clinicians weigh trends, symptoms, and vital sign responses."]
